00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.980
And it just reminds me of her, like,

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.960
we're always gonna be back then.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.760
She was amazing.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.980
