00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.100
She was an amazing person.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.620
And my family has never
been the same without her.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.655
And I feel her with me every day.

00:00:39.655 --> 00:00:42.899
And that song just really,
it means a lot to me.

00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:44.283
It does.

00:00:45.176 --> 00:00:47.939
