00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.310
It's just that one of us
wanted to have children

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.510
and one of us didn't.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.703
And that's why I'm sitting next to his.

00:10:03.942 --> 00:10:05.373
But not mine.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.460
We didn't separate because

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.750
we didn't love each other anymore.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.280
That's the difference between us

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.837
and a lot of divorces or separations.

00:10:13.837 --> 00:10:15.000
We loved each other.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.840
We had different things we wanted to do.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.680
So after he went off and made babies,

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.670
we opened up a business together.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.960
And we built restaurants.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:28.740
And we built restaurants for
the last 25 years together.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.690
We both ran the same company.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.180
So we saw each other
and talked to each other

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:34.920
day and night all the time.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.590
And then, when he had these children,

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:40.819
although I hate children, hate children,

00:10:40.819 --> 00:10:45.379
I fell in love with his
children one at a time.

00:10:45.379 --> 00:10:46.770
Unexpectedly.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.021
Have no idea why or how.

00:10:49.021 --> 00:10:51.690
Now they are both my Goddaughters.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.540
You know, when you talk about
modern family on television

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.340
and everything like
that and everybody has,

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:59.190
you know, 2 mothers and 14 whatevers.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:03.090
We have our own strangely
constructed family.

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:06.423
But I'm not in his life
in any competitive way.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.660
I do not sleep with him.

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:13.138
I do not want him. I do
not want his daughters.

00:11:13.138 --> 00:11:16.050
I just sort of slid in

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:19.340
in a way where we never knew
that there was gonna be a slot

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:20.970
for such a person.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:23.520
And I never knew I would
wanna be in that slot.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:25.440
But there is a slot,

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.450
and somehow I fit into it.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.590
And here we are.

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:31.503
And I have to tell you
that it is 50 years later.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.710
Okay. How do you like that?

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.380
Well, we didn't talk
politics, so that was good.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.220
(laughing) Politics are like really boring

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.275
compared to what I just gave you.

00:11:43.275 --> 00:11:44.370
- [Interviewer] Okay,
well thank you so much.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.203
- It was a pleasure.

